### ✅ Deliverables

#### **MonacoEditorWrapper Class** (Browser Editor Interface)
- Configuration management (theme, font size, line numbers, code folding)
- Content management (setValue, getValue, getRangeContent)
- Theme switching (vs, vs-dark, hc-black)
- Position tracking and navigation (goToLine, getCurrentLine)
- Error/diagnostic markers with severity levels
- Event system (addEventListener, removeEventListener, emit)
- Format and find-replace utilities

#### **GCodeLanguageProvider Class** (Language Services)
- **Validation:** Real-time G-Code syntax checking
  - Validates G-code numbers (0-99)
  - Validates M-code numbers (0-999)
  - Detects unbalanced parentheses
  - Checks parameter-value pairing

- **Command Detection:** Extracts all commands from G-Code
  - G-codes (including decimals like G38.2)
  - M-codes
  - Parameters (X, Y, Z, F, S, T, D, H, I, P)
  - Returns sorted, deduplicated lists

- **Formatting:** Normalizes G-Code style
  - Converts to uppercase
  - Normalizes whitespace
  - Preserves comments
  - Returns formatted code

#### **Autocomplete Suggestions** (50+ Commands)
**Motion Commands:**
- G0 (Rapid), G1 (Linear), G2/G3 (Arcs), G4 (Dwell), G28 (Home)

**Plane & Mode Selection:**
- G17/G18/G19 (Plane selection)
- G20/G21 (Inch/Metric)
- G90/G91 (Absolute/Incremental)

**Spindle & Tool:**
- M3/M4/M5 (Spindle control)
- M6 (Tool change)
- T (Tool selection)

**Flow Control:**
- M0/M1/M30 (Stop/End)

**Auto-leveling:**
- G38.2/G38.3 (Probing)

**Parameters:**
- X, Y, Z, F (Feed), S (Spindle), T (Tool), D, H, I, P

